        "url": "/api/v2/version/22/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "なくときは　ナイフのような　うでを\nむねの　まえで　こうささせる。\nそっきょうで　メロディを　つくる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "울 때는 나이프 같은 팔을\n가슴 앞에서 교차시킨다.\n즉흥으로 멜로디를 만든다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il croise ses bras affûtés devant son torse pour crier.\nIl compose tout un tas de mélodies.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Wenn es ruft, verschränkt es seine messerartigen\nArme vor der Brust. Es komponiert aus dem Stegreif.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando llora, cruza sus brazos con forma de cuchillo.\nPuede improvisar melodías.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quando canta tiene le zampe incrociate al petto.\nSa improvvisare melodie.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It crosses its knifelike arms in front of its chest\nwhen it cries. It can compose melodies ad lib.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "鳴くときは　ナイフのような　腕を\n胸の　前で　交差させる。\n即興で　メロディを　作る。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando llora, cruza sus brazos con forma de cuchillo.\nPuede improvisar melodías.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "かんじょうを　メロディで　あらわす。\nメロディの　ほうそくせいを\nがくしゃたちが　けんきゅうしている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "감정을 멜로디로 나타낸다.\n멜로디의 법칙성을\n학자들이 연구하고 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il exprime ses émotions par des mélodies.\nLes scientifiques étudient actuellement leur structure.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Über seine Melodien teilt es seine Gefühle mit.\nWissenschaftler untersuchen das Muster der Melodien.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Los científicos tratan de estudiar sus melodías, que\nson reflejo de sus emociones.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Esprime le proprie emozioni con melodie, che sono\noggetto di studio di molti scienziati.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It signals its emotions with its melodies. Scientists\nare studying these melodic patterns.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
